## Project Structure Guide

- **App Router**: Entry is under `src/app`
  - Root layout: [src/app/layout.tsx](mdc:src/app/layout.tsx)
  - Home page: [src/app/page.tsx](mdc:src/app/page.tsx)
  - Global styles: [src/app/globals.css](mdc:src/app/globals.css)

- **Database (Prisma + Postgres)**
  - Prisma client singleton: [src/lib/db.ts](mdc:src/lib/db.ts)
  - Prisma schema: [prisma/schema.prisma](mdc:prisma/schema.prisma)
  - Seed script: [scripts/seed.ts](mdc:scripts/seed.ts)
  - Local DB via Docker: [docker-compose.yml](mdc:docker-compose.yml)

- **Configuration**
  - Next.js config: [next.config.ts](mdc:next.config.ts)
  - TypeScript config (alias `@/*` → `src/*`): [tsconfig.json](mdc:tsconfig.json)
  - ESLint (Next core web vitals): [eslint.config.mjs](mdc:eslint.config.mjs)
  - Vercel build settings: [vercel.json](mdc:vercel.json)
  - Project scripts: [package.json](mdc:package.json)
  - Docs: [README.md](mdc:README.md)

- **Common scripts**
  - Dev server: `npm run dev`
  - Build/start: `npm run build` / `npm start`
  - Prisma: `npm run migrate:deploy`, `npm run seed`
  - Docker DB: `npm run db:up`, `npm run db:down`, `npm run db:logs`

Notes:
- The codebase uses ESM and strict TypeScript. Prefer imports via the `@/*` path alias where possible.
- Server Components are default in App Router; add `"use client"` only when required by client-only APIs.

